      "term": "bear",
      "example": "A bear emerged from the forest beside the lake.",
      "originalSense": {
        "id": "kaikki:c5ed35d73f46be2f7c",
        "definition": "A large, generally omnivorous mammal (a few species are purely carnivorous or herbivorous) of the family Ursidae; having shaggy fur, a very small tail, and flat feet.",
